{
  "id": "RAW_14cc9a6259",
  "title": "NeurIPS 26｜新国立提出 PEEK：扩散生成采样「偷看」一步，相同步数下 FID 可压 49 点，即插即用",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA3MzI4MjgzMw==&mid=2651075779&idx=3&sn=ff8f20a1a0f4b849a0dbf430478343ba",
  "date": "2026-11-23 17:30:00",
  "author": "机器之心",
  "siteName": "机器之心",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>机器之心</span> <span>2026-11-23 17:30</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261123113105_7774326.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>FID最高下降49.3%</p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.266015625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2560\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"503548874\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260716142500_f29434b.png\"></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">扩散模型（Diffusion）画图，就像从噪声里找出画面。多采样几步，图片通常会更清楚。但如果开头就画歪了，后面再细致描绘，也可能「越描越黑」。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">新加坡国立大学团队提出的 PEEK（往前偷看一步），想解决的就是这个问题。这项被 NeurIPS 2026 接收的研究</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">无需重新训练模型</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，只改变确定性扩散模型的采样方式：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">先往前看一步，再决定眼下怎么走。</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\">为什么图片会越画越偏？</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">训练时，</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">同一张真图被加上不同程度的噪声，但去噪目标始终是原图。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">生成时，</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">从纯噪声出发，前一步结果成为后一步输入。尤其在早期，模型预测出的「清晰图片」往往仍然模糊、形状不准。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这就是</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">曝光偏差（Exposure Bias）：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">训练时输入来自「真实图片加噪」，生成时却要处理「自己生成的、可能画错的中间结果」。错误可能一轮轮积累。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">固定模型、采样器下，传统方式主要通过增加采样步数、密集度提升生成质量，但这并不一定是相同采样成本下的最优解。团队思考，随着采样推进，输入噪声越来越少，模型输出的图片通常越来越清楚。既然下一步预测可能更清晰、高质、接近训练时的真实图片，何不拿它作为模型输入来改进眼下这步输出？</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\">先试画，再落笔</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">想象一位画家：普通采样是画一笔、看一笔；PEEK 则先在脑海中预演下一笔，看看效果怎样进一步提升，再回到原处直接画出提升版。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">具体做法是：先</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">临时走到下一步</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">；在噪声更少的位置，再预测一次清晰图片；最后</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">回到当前状态</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，用前瞻预测作为输入，重新计算并提交当前步输出。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这在数学逻辑上也是自洽的：训练时，不同噪声水平对应同一个清晰目标。因此，在确定性采样更新中，把后一步输出往前交换为模型输入，并不违背扩散生成模型的采样逻辑。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">相比一味增加普通采样步数、把路径切得更密，PEEK 有机会更早纠正偏离的方向，避免后续错误继续积累。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin: 3pt 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;overflow: hidden;transform: rotate(0deg);width: 554.133px;height: 198.098px;text-indent: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"503591914\" data-ratio=\"0.3574074074074074\" width=\"554.133\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" height=\"198.098\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;width: 554.133px;height: 198.098px;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261123113105_2b810cd.png\"></span></span></p>\n  <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\" data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(123, 12, 0);font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;\">论文链接：<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05407\" target=\"_blank\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.05407</a></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(123, 12, 0);font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;\">项目网站：<a href=\"https://dachengruoque.github.io/PEEK-Video/\" target=\"_blank\">https://dachengruoque.github.io/PEEK-Video/</a></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(123, 12, 0);font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;\">视频简介：<a href=\"https://dachengruoque.github.io/PEEK-Video/PEEK.mp4\" target=\"_blank\">https://dachengruoque.github.io/PEEK-Video/PEEK.mp4</a></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(123, 12, 0);font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;\">代码链接：<a href=\"https://github.com/DaChengRuoQue/PEEK\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/DaChengRuoQue/PEEK</a></span></span></p>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5733333333333334\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"675\" height=\"317.703\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;width: 554.133px;height: 317.703px;\" width=\"554.133\" data-imgfileid=\"503591915\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261123113105_80fec93.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-style: italic;\">论文图 1，普通采样、相同 NFE 采样与 PEEK 采样轨迹对比</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\">哪些步骤值得「偷看」？</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">但多看一次，就多消耗一次模型计算；如果前瞻预测也有偏差，还可能把错误放大。不同模型适合「偷看」的位置也不同。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">为此，PEEK 可选用</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">贪心搜索</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，逐步寻找有用的位置。只有效果变好，并胜过</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">模型调用次数相同、普通步骤更密集的采样方案</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，才保留这次前瞻。默认用 FID 衡量效果，越低代表生成图片的整体分布越接近真实图片；搜索优化也能改用其它指标，如多样性指标、组合多项指标等。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">搜索本身计算也做了缓存优化。团队设计两种缓存：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">前缀缓存</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">保存已经算好的噪声状态；</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">噪声重映射缓存</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">让普通采样在调整时间位置时复用已有结果。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">在 9 步搜索中，计算调用从 225 次降至 78 次，减少 65.3%。而且同一模型、采样器、采样步数和优化指标，只需预先搜索一次，不必每张图都重新搜索。论文报告的最长搜索时间仅为&nbsp;</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">2.2 分钟</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">；CIFAR-10 的 9 步搜索约需 20 秒。该一次性搜索成本是 PEEK&nbsp;</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">唯一额外成本</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">团队还提出&nbsp;</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">PEEK-G</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">：PEEK 主要选择哪一步的「清晰图片预测」，PEEK-G 则将当前与前瞻一步的</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">采样方向按比例混合</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，为 DPM-Solver 类采样器提供更灵活的纠偏方式。</span></span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\">效果如何？数字和图片都能看到</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">团队在 CIFAR-10、LSUN 卧室、ImageNet 和 MS-COCO 等数据集上测试了不同模型，涵盖不同分辨率、像素空间与潜空间、无条件与文本生成等场景，也验证了多种采样器。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">在</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">相同模型调用预算</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">下，ImageNet-EDM 的 FID 从</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;19.71 降至 9.99</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，下降&nbsp;</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">49.3%</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">；LSUN 卧室 EDM 从</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;22.89 降至 11.77</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，下降</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;48.6%</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">；CIFAR-10 一组 9 步实验从&nbsp;</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">25.80 降至 20.23</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，下降&nbsp;</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">21.6%</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。PEEK-G 在 MS-COCO 上也实现</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;26.0%&nbsp;</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">的 FID 降幅。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">论文图片对比中，卧室的床品和窗帘细节更鲜明，骑行者轮廓更清楚。PEEK 尽量沿原有生成方向把画面修好。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"503591921\" data-ratio=\"0.4935185185185185\" width=\"554.133\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" height=\"273.487\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;width: 554.133px;height: 273.487px;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261123113105_058a308.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5037037037037037\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" height=\"279.067\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;width: 554.133px;height: 279.067px;\" width=\"554.133\" data-imgfileid=\"503591916\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261123113105_c01671c.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4935185185185185\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" height=\"273.729\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;width: 554.133px;height: 273.729px;\" width=\"554.133\" data-imgfileid=\"503591920\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261123113105_7844624.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4935185185185185\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" height=\"273.729\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;width: 554.133px;height: 273.729px;\" width=\"554.133\" data-imgfileid=\"503591923\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261123113105_a39bfde.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-style: italic;\">同等计算步数下的效果对比</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">然而，不同模型有不同效果，PEEK 并不能保证所有模型都有同样幅度提升。但这项研究提供了一个新思路：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 66, 123);font-weight: bold;\">算力未必都要花在多走几步上，提前看准方向也很重要。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">总结优势，PEEK 可大幅提升部分模型采样效果，最高在 ImageNet-EDM 模型上 FID 提升可达 49.3%。模型本身无须重新训练，额外成本仅为可选的一次性搜索，且无须局限特定模型、采样器。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">作者简介</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">第一作者白蕴维，本科、博士毕业于新加坡国立大学计算机专业，主要研究多模态学习、大语言模型与模型泛化。第二作者 Tan Ying Kiat，本科获全额奖学金，毕业于斯坦福大学电子工程、社会学双专业，博士毕业于新加坡国立大学计算机专业，曾任职于新加坡武装部队、政府。目前主要研究大语言模型、推荐系统。第一、二作者导师为新加坡国立大学前副校长陈祖翰教授。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0px 8px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.7372549019607844\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1020\" style=\"height: 1004px;vertical-align: middle;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline: 0px;color: rgb(67, 65, 65);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);pointer-events: initial;width: 578px;visibility: visible !important;\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"1140\" data-imgfileid=\"503584949\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261116124258_29432f9.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0px;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);text-size-adjust: auto;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 27.2px;\"><span mp-original-font-size=\"12\" mp-original-line-height=\"19.200000762939453\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size: 12px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 19.2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">© THE END&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0px;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);text-size-adjust: auto;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 27.2px;\"><span mp-original-font-size=\"12\" mp-original-line-height=\"19.200000762939453\" style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);line-height: 19.2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">转载请联系本公众号获得授权</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0px;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);text-size-adjust: auto;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 27.2px;\"><span mp-original-font-size=\"12\" mp-original-line-height=\"19.200000762939453\" style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);line-height: 19.2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">投稿或寻求报道：liyazhou@jiqizhixin.com</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "新加坡国立大学提出 PEEK 框架，通过在采样过程中「提前偷看」下一步的清晰预测，优化当前步的输出选择，无需重新训练模型即可在相同模型调用次数下将 FID 最高降低 49.3%。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "新加坡国立大学提出 PEEK 框架，通过在采样过程中「提前偷看」下一步的清晰预测，优化当前步的输出选择，无需重新训练模型即可在相同模型调用次数下将 FID 最高降低 49.3%。",
  "summary": "PEEK（Peek Ahead）是新加坡国立大学为解决扩散模型生成过程中曝光偏差导致的累积误差问题而提出的采样优化方法。该方法通过在确定性采样过程中，先临时走到下一步噪声更少的位置预测清晰图片，再将该预测作为输入回到当前步进行重新计算，从而在相同模型调用预算下纠正早期偏离的方向。为提高搜索效率，团队设计了前缀缓存和噪声重映射缓存，显著降低了前瞻预测的计算开销。实验在 CIFAR-10、LSUN 卧室、ImageNet 和 MS-COCO 等数据集上进行，覆盖不同分辨率、像素空间与潜空间、无条件与文本生成等场景。结果显示，在 ImageNet-EDM 上 FID 从 19.71 降至 9.99，下降 49.3%；LSUN 卧室 EDM 从 22.89 降至 11.77，下降 48.6%；CIFAR-10 实验中 FID 从 25.80 降至 20.23，下降 21.6%。此外，团队还提出 PEEK-G 变体，通过混合当前与前瞻步的采样方向为 DPM-Solver 类采样器提供更灵活的纠偏方式。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "PEEK 框架的核心思想：提前偷看下一步清晰预测",
      "explanation": "在扩散采样过程中，先临时走到下一步噪声更少的位置预测清晰图片，再将该预测作为输入回到当前步重新计算输出，从而纠正早期因曝光偏差导致的累积误差。"
    },
    {
      "point": "搜索优化与计算缓存机制降低额外开销",
      "explanation": "通过前缀缓存保存已计算的噪声状态和噪声重映射缓存复用结果，9 步搜索将模型调用次数从 225 次降至 78 次，减少 65.3%，且一次性搜索成本可在后续生成中复用。"
    },
    {
      "point": "PEEK-G 变体提供更灵活的采样纠偏方式",
      "explanation": "PEEK-G 将当前步与前瞻步的采样方向按比例混合，为 DPM-Solver 类采样器提供更灵活的纠偏方式，进一步提升生成质量。"
    },
    {
      "point": "实验验证在多数据集上的显著 FID 提升",
      "explanation": "在 ImageNet-EDM 上 FID 从 19.71 降至 9.99（降幅 49.3%），LSUN 卧室 EDM 从 22.89 降至 11.77（降幅 48.6%），CIFAR-10 从 25.80 降至 20.23（降幅 21.6%），证明方法在不同模型和场景下的有效性。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "PEEK 通过提前偷看一步的清晰预测，优化当前步的输出选择，在相同模型调用次数下将 FID 最高降低 49.3%。",
    "在 ImageNet-EDM 上，PEEK 将 FID 从 19.71 降至 9.99，下降 49.3%。",
    "9 步搜索将模型调用次数从 225 次降至 78 次，减少 65.3%。"
  ],
